{"2973830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crime Shop Simulator: A Prison Boss Game", "steam_appid": 2973830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4200010, 3998130, 4377660, 4377680, 4316250, 4094610, 3990140, 3876360, 3876340, 3876320, 3876280, 3859360, 3751870, 4058180], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/103bd9937e1a08a05df4a63b19aeff2e.poster.avif?t=1779808324\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/103bd9937e1a08a05df4a63b19aeff2e.webm?t=1779808324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime Shop Simulator: A Prison Boss Game brings the crafting and simulation antics of Prison Boss VR out of the slammer and onto the streets!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to New Yolk City,  a wonderful place to live, except that the Mayor has gone on a banning spree. Run a chain of stalls crafting legal and not-quite-legal merchandise,  all on a quest to conquer the black market and get super duper rich!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SOLO OR GET A PARTNER IN CRIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can become a self-made-egg, play in co-op with one of your friends… or recruit a totally reliable stranger from the internet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/5796e719789d64d2e47d3b57d3377ad3.webp?t=1779808324\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/5796e719789d64d2e47d3b57d3377ad3.poster.avif?t=1779808324\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras_big/5796e719789d64d2e47d3b57d3377ad3.webp?t=1779808324 width=800 height=356 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT WITHOUT GETTING CAUGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew beer, roll cigarettes, and adapt as the Mayor flip-flops on what’s prohibited. But be careful, the New Yolk Police Department are intensifying their crackdown on contraband. If they catch you or your partner, they’ll seize your merchandise, and your business will be plucked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/307f28ddaf5e3869ddff6653e5c8f998.webp?t=1779808324\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/307f28ddaf5e3869ddff6653e5c8f998.poster.avif?t=1779808324\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras_big/307f28ddaf5e3869ddff6653e5c8f998.webp?t=1779808324 width=800 height=356 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARN CASH AND BUILD YOUR REPUTATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your merchandise to everyone, from workers to the wealthy, to earn cash. Accept special jobs to boost your reputation among the different factions of the city. Build that street cred!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/7eae4a380e56d801e890ae9a571b8a7d.webp?t=1779808324\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/7eae4a380e56d801e890ae9a571b8a7d.poster.avif?t=1779808324\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras_big/7eae4a380e56d801e890ae9a571b8a7d.webp?t=1779808324 width=800 height=356 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR SHOPS AND LOOKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that you're rich, it’s time to get richer! Upgrade your shop and equipment to increase efficiency. Enhance your appearance to become the coolest cock-a-doodle-dude in town! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/4a16f59edda88c608e337e2f72079f1f.webp?t=1779808324\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/4a16f59edda88c608e337e2f72079f1f.poster.avif?t=1779808324\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras_big/4a16f59edda88c608e337e2f72079f1f.webp?t=1779808324 width=800 height=356 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME WILL ALSO INCLUDE:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ items to craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >… And more!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/103bd9937e1a08a05df4a63b19aeff2e.poster.avif?t=1779808324\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/103bd9937e1a08a05df4a63b19aeff2e.webm?t=1779808324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime Shop Simulator: A Prison Boss Game brings the crafting and simulation antics of Prison Boss VR out of the slammer and onto the streets!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to New Yolk City,  a wonderful place to live, except that the Mayor has gone on a banning spree. Run a chain of stalls crafting legal and not-quite-legal merchandise,  all on a quest to conquer the black market and get super duper rich!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SOLO OR GET A PARTNER IN CRIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can become a self-made-egg, play in co-op with one of your friends… or recruit a totally reliable stranger from the internet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/5796e719789d64d2e47d3b57d3377ad3.webp?t=1779808324\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/5796e719789d64d2e47d3b57d3377ad3.poster.avif?t=1779808324\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras_big/5796e719789d64d2e47d3b57d3377ad3.webp?t=1779808324 width=800 height=356 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT WITHOUT GETTING CAUGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew beer, roll cigarettes, and adapt as the Mayor flip-flops on what’s prohibited. But be careful, the New Yolk Police Department are intensifying their crackdown on contraband. If they catch you or your partner, they’ll seize your merchandise, and your business will be plucked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/307f28ddaf5e3869ddff6653e5c8f998.webp?t=1779808324\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/307f28ddaf5e3869ddff6653e5c8f998.poster.avif?t=1779808324\" class=\"bb_img\" data-b